                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16758168" author="pavlukhin" created="Fri, 1 Feb 2019 10:11:56 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;A flaw in compound &lt;tt&gt;PartitionCountersNeighborcastFuture&lt;/tt&gt; initialization was found. A response from remote node might have been received before mini future was added to parent. As a result a mini future and therefore a parent future was never completed.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16759703" author="gvvinblade" created="Mon, 4 Feb 2019 09:13:44 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=Pavlukhin&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;Pavlukhin&quot;&gt;Pavlukhin&lt;/a&gt;, looks OK, merged to master.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
